"roe>raven": ["ga", "Corvus corax", "Capreolus capreolus"], "squirrel>raven": ["ga", "Corvus corax", "Sciurus vulgaris"], "squirrel>owl": ["ga", "Strix aluco", "Sciurus vulgaris"], "vole>wolf": ["ga", "Canis lupus", "Myodes glareolus"], "squirrel>wolf": ["ga", "Canis lupus", "Sciurus vulgaris"], "raven>wolf": ["ga", "Canis lupus", "Corvus corax"], "owl>wolf": ["ga", "Canis lupus", "Strix aluco"], "boar>lynx": ["ga", "Lynx lynx", "Sus scrofa"], "vole>lynx": ["ga", "Lynx lynx", "Myodes glareolus"]}, "story": "Białowieża Forest straddles the border of Poland and Belarus. It is one of the last and largest remaining parts of the primeval forest that once stretched across the European Plain. More than 800 European bison, Europe's heaviest land animal, live there.", "matters": "Europe's heaviest land animal survives here: bison were reintroduced to the park in 1929. Visits to its strictly protected areas are by guided tour."}